      "lines": [
        "问题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "（1）叙述关于两个不同的小车相互作用的实验."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "2",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "（2）这两个小车中哪一个的质量大？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "3",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "（3）举出一个能表明如何根据物体所获得速度来比较物",
        "体质量的例子."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "4",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "（4）质量的单位是什么？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "5",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "（5）你还知道哪些质量的单位？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "练习 10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "（1）为什么当人从一只不大的船上跳下来的时候，船将以和人的",
        "速度差不多相同的速度向后退？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "2",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "（2）用枪射击时应把枪紧紧地抵在肩上，这样做反冲的速度就会",
        "减小. 为什么？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "3",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "（3）制造猎枪子弹时要考虑枪的质量：供轻枪用的霰弹的火药量",
        "要比供重枪用的小些. 试解释其道理."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "4",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "（4）人从一只静止的小船上以 $5$ 米/秒的速度跳下，这时船以 $0.5$",
        "米/秒的速度荡开. 问船的质量是人的质量的多少倍？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "24. 用天平和秤测量物体的质量"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "现在我们已经知道，通过比较两个静止物体由于相互作",
        "用而获得的速度，可以确定其中一个物体的质量是另一个物"
      ]
    },
